":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 6.900001, 17.999817","ID":510,"Text":"Transformer name: Star Scream (⭐🤯)","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"40.000000, 6.900001, 16.999756","ID":559,"Text":"Disclamer: The robot is too big and cant 100% fit in the jet body","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.666667, 0.000000, 0.666667","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"27.000000, 6.900001, -7.000244","ID":753,"Text":"Hides the arms and legs when in plane mode (A feature)","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.000000, 0.000000, 1.000000","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 6.900001, -17.000244","ID":1750,"Text":"why is this the transformation button???","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.694118, 0.654902, 1.000000","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"32.000000, 6.900001, -7.000244","ID":1766,"Text":"Are the arms missles? IDK I only watched 1 transformer movie (IDK the name)","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.356863, 0.364706, 0.411765","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"57.000000, 6.900001, -21.000244","ID":2298,"Text":"Useless Ahhh Button ;-;","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.666667, 0.000000, 0.666667","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"27.000000, 10.900001, -7.000244","ID":2339,"Text":"Can also make this transformer small or in crouch mode while in robot mode","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.015686, 0.686275, 0.925490","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 10.900001, -17.000244","ID":2398,"Text":"Expands and contracts the arms","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 6.900001, -33.000244","ID":2443,"Text":"All of these are part of the Pre-Setup","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-0.000, 0.000, -0.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"18.000000, 9.199997, -21.699341","ID":2447,"Text":"FitLikeRarra's Chair so she dosn't get trolled in BABFT","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"45.000000, 6.900001, 16.999756","ID":2448,"Text":"Various piston lengths were experimented. This save is the best option ;-;","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.000000, 0.000000","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 6.900001, -43.000244","ID":2449,"Text":"Arm switch toggles: Red for a weapon type.","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.011765, 0.686275, 0.921569","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"34.000000, 6.900001, -43.000244","ID":2450,"Text":"Arm switch toggles: Sky for configuration. ","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.596078, 0.862745","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"43.000000, 10.699995, 16.999695","ID":2451,"Text":"If you arre done doing your configuration, make the wh&serv transparent","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"53.000000, 6.900001, 16.999756","ID":2459,"Text":"Is the jet model replacable (kitbassh)? Yessir.","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.349020, 0.349020","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"58.000000, 6.900001, 16.999756","ID":2460,"Text":"and Rarra does not build jets ","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.596078, 0.862745","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"58.000000, 10.900001, 16.999756","ID":2461,"Text":"But Rarra is lazy","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.596078, 0.862745","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"43.000000, 14.299995, 16.999634","ID":2462,"Text":"Disclamer: Since servo angles don't save pls set shoulders to 20 ","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"0.905882, 0.905882, 0.925490","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"28.000000, 14.900001, -17.000244","ID":2468,"Text":"The following buttons are on the Jet :>","NumberValues":[]},{"ShowShadow":true,"CanCollide":true,"Color":"1.000000, 0.596078, 0.862745","Anchored":true,"BoolValues":[],"Rotation":"-180.000, 0.000, -180.000","Transparency":0,"Position":"43.000000, 18.299995, 16.999634","ID":2469,"Text":"The transformer uses PC controls for the wheels. (Q and E)","NumberValues":[]}]}]